* Product name: **HappyPaws** (never HappyPets; PawMinder only as historical Figma filename metadata)
* Subtitle: Pet Routine & Medication Tracker
* Application ID: `com.auramislab.happypaws`
* Organization: AuraMis Lab
* Workspace (this clone): Android HappyPaws repository root

## Authoritative URLs

* GitHub: https://github.com/efrshuvo-bd/happypaws
* Default branch: `main`
* Integration branch: `develop`
* Jira project: HAP — https://auramislab.atlassian.net/browse/HAP
* Board: https://auramislab.atlassian.net/jira/software/projects/HAP/boards/72
* Confluence space: HA — parent https://auramislab.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/HA/pages/5898628
